# gh #51 (docs/20 U26), the user's ask: G0 twice starts a hands-free memo on the second
# press (no words lost); letting go ends nothing; the page says so plainly while Mando
# listens; one G0 press ends it, saved. A single tap still opens the note, once the 0.35 s
# double-tap window ran out. Locked, it goes on; G0 on the lit card ends it and the card
# says it was saved. The 5-minute cap ends a hands-free memo too. docs/20 D5: ` leaves the
# note (Fn+` would type a backtick into it).
# After the review: a slow second tap (to 1 s) still starts it and closes the empty note;
# a slow tap-then-hold records; tapping twice to end opens nothing; Tab, Enter does not end
# it; the menu's row starts one that ends at the cap with nothing held.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1000
press g0
shot note  点一下 G0：等 0.35 秒没有第二下，打开记一条
press `
wait 600
press g0
press g0
mic 3000 speech
shot handsfree  点两下 G0：免提录音，松开也在录；Mando 在听；提示栏"G0 结束 1-9 选项目 Opt+L 锁屏"（0 不归属在图例里）
press 2
mic 1500 speech
shot handsfree-tag  免提时按 2：存到第 2 个项目，录音不停
press tab
shot handsfree-menu  免提时的 Tab 菜单：G0 结束并保存（只是说明）、0-9、Opt+L
press enter
mic 300 speech
shot handsfree-menu-enter  Tab 再 Enter：不结束，提示"按一下 G0 结束并保存"
press tab
mic 800 speech
press g0
wait 300
shot handsfree-saved  再按一下 G0：结束，"录音已保存"
wait 2600
# tapping twice to end, as it started: the second tap opens nothing
press g0
press g0
mic 2000 speech
press g0
press g0
wait 600
shot end-double  点两下结束：存下，第二下不打开记一条
wait 2600
# a slow double tap (the second press 0.5 s after the first): the note opens, then closes
press g0
wait 470
shot slow-note  第一下后 0.35 秒：记一条已打开
press g0
mic 1500 speech
shot slow-handsfree  0.5 秒后第二下：记一条关上，免提录音开始
press g0
wait 2600
# tap, then hold: an ordinary held memo (the hold started it, no words lost)
press g0
down g0
wait 800
mic 1500 speech
shot tap-then-hold  点一下再按住：照常是按住说的便条
up g0
wait 900
wait 2600
# a slow tap-then-hold (the hold 1.2 s after the tap): the empty note closes, a held memo
press g0
wait 1170
down g0
wait 600
mic 1500 speech
shot slow-hold  点一下，1.2 秒后再按住：空的记一条关上，照常按住说
up g0
wait 900
wait 2600
# locked: it goes on; G0 from dark only lights the card; on the lit card it ends and says so
press g0
press g0
mic 1500 speech
press opt+l
mic 4000 speech
shot locked  免提时 Opt+L：锁屏，录音不停
press g0
mic 300 speech
shot locked-card  锁着点一下 G0：只亮卡片，"免提录音中：按 G0 结束"
press g0
wait 300
shot locked-ended  卡片亮着再按 G0：结束，卡片写"√ 已存"、Mando 存好了（docs/20 B1），仍锁着
wait 2200
shot locked-still  结束后卡片还亮着（从结束那一下算 3 秒）
wait 1500
shot locked-dark  3 秒后熄灭
press g0
shot locked-again  再点亮：结果已看过，回到"先点 G0 再按住说 · 点两下免提"
press opt+l
press enter
wait 2600
# the menu's row "双击G0 免提说一段", then the 5-minute cap: saved, nothing held
press tab
press right
press down down down down down down down
shot menu-row  Tab → 去哪：双击G0 免提说一段
press enter
mic 290000 2500
shot cap-4m50  免提 4:50（从菜单开始）
mic 12000 2500
shot cap  5:00 自动停：已到 5 分钟上限 · 已存，没有"松开 G0"
press tab
shot cap-tab  Tab 马上能用
press tab
wait 2600
